Answer: Under the EU capacity allocation and congestion management framework, congestion income must be distributed **"as soon as reasonably practicable and no later than one week after the congestion incomes have been transferred"** [Article 73(3) of Commission Regulation (EU) 2015/1222](https://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/02015R1222-20210315).

